        "toolDescription": "Get availability in Google Calendar. Call this before confirming or promising any viewing slot. Business hours are Monday to Saturday, 9 AM to 7 PM. Viewings are 45 minutes.\n\nNever treat your own earlier messages as proof a slot is free. Always check here first, even if a time was mentioned earlier. The calendar is the source of truth."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
